      <p id="dataStatusText">內建《廢車回收處理業數據彙整》最新數據（截至 115-10）｜ 支援匯入新版 Excel 即時更新</p>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <div class="control-box">
        <label>比較基準模式</label>
        <select id="modeSelect">
          <option value="yoy_sync" selected>115 vs 114 同期累計比較</option>
          <option value="full_year">全年度總覽比較 (114全年 vs 115累計)</option>
          <option value="only_115">僅檢視 115 年度</option>
          <option value="only_114">僅檢視 114 年度</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="control-box">
        <label>截止月份篩選</label>
        <select id="monthSelect"></select>
      </div>
      <div class="control-box">
        <label>處理廠別檢視</label>
        <select id="plantSelect">
          <option value="4家合計" selected>4家合計 (整體)</option>
          <option value="帝壹統">帝壹統</option>
          <option value="集合成">集合成</option>
          <option value="綠化">綠化</option>
          <option value="巨基">巨基</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <input type="file" id="excelInput" accept=".xlsx,.xls" style="display:none" />
      <button class="upload-btn" onclick="document.getElementById('excelInput').click()" title="上傳更新後的 Excel 檔即可自動刷新全部圖表">
        📂 匯入新版 Excel 更新
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- KPI CARDS -->
  <div class="kpi-grid" id="kpiGrid"></div>

  <!-- MIDDLE SECTION -->
  <div class="mid-grid">
    <!-- LEFT: RECYCLING -->
    <div class="col-stack">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <h3 class="card-title">【回收業】月度廢車回收流向與總重量趨勢</h3>
          <span class="badge">全國回收端數據</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-wrap" style="height: 270px;">
          <canvas id="chartRecycleTrend"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <h3 class="card-title" id="titleVehicleMix">【回收業】汽、機車回收去向結構差異</h3>
          <span class="badge">認證 / 出口 / 其他佔比</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-wrap" style="height: 155px;">
          <canvas id="chartVehicleMix"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT: PROCESSING & INVENTORY -->
    <div class="col-stack">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <h3 class="card-title" id="titleShellFlow">【處理業】廢車殼「進場來源 vs 投料量 vs 庫存水位」</h3>
          <span class="badge" id="badgePlant1">4家合計</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-wrap" style="height: 210px;">
          <canvas id="chartShellFlow"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <h3 class="card-title" id="titleAsrFlow">【庫存檢核重點】ASR-DF 產銷去化與 ASR/ASRDF 庫存追蹤</h3>
          <span class="badge badge-alert" id="badgeAsrAlert">庫存攀升監控</span>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-wrap" style="height: 215px;">
          <canvas id="chartAsrFlow"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- BOTTOM SECTION -->
  <div class="bot-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h3 class="card-title" id="titlePlantCompare">【4家處理業比較】進場規模與認證/非認證結構</h3>
        <span class="badge">點擊右側表格可切換單廠</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height: 235px;">
        <canvas id="chartPlantCompare"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h3 class="card-title" id="titleAuditTable">【4家處理業與整體】營運量能暨庫存健康度檢核表</h3>
        <span class="badge">期末庫存單位：公噸</span>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
        <table id="auditTable"></table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

